<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific cargo turnover up in 1996.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific cargo turnover up in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said on Wednesday its cargo business posted a turnover growth of 5.6 percent in calendar 1996 from a year earlier.</p>
<p>Turnover totalled HK$6.11 billion or US$783 million, representing about 20.5 percent of Cathay's total traffic turnover, the Hong Kong flag carrier said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company posted 1996 net profit of HK$3.81 billion, up from HK$2.98 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
